    "alt": "放學後，小男孩坐在書桌前的椅子上認真看著數學作業簿，爸爸面帶微笑坐在旁邊親切指點，桌上整齊擺放著鉛筆與檯燈。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "After school, Ben sits on a "
        },
        {
          "text": "chair",
          "wordIds": [
            "chair"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " at his "
        },
        {
          "text": "desk",
          "wordIds": [
            "desk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "放學後，Ben 坐在書桌前的椅子上。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/after-school-homework/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "ca819f33aa8609d0b17b41a0b4d4dc4f9e034078f68e3068436808fe7205681b",
        "sha256": "b10e45ae508e2605f03a266b41c2eb0ec496f721018864c3fc6eb351f03383e1"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He opens his workbook to do his "
        },
        {
          "text": "homework",
          "wordIds": [
            "homework"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他打開練習本開始寫功課。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/after-school-homework/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "967e113cb3dea7a0091059caebadc8ac964ddc431f7fc8180ccb9412f50671fa",
        "sha256": "5f68633b10388921169a29c46810d90b72fd9217b473ef8c40938f9d0552a7f0"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "One "
        },
        {
          "text": "math",
          "wordIds": [
            "math"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "question",
          "wordIds": [
            "question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is hard, so Ben thinks carefully."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "有一題數學題目很難，所以 Ben 認真思考。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/after-school-homework/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "deecc253b84873e20afb1dc1611649ac5810d3c62fc8595b1ffb0109679b9ec1",
        "sha256": "5d4e5b597a3713cb636a333d99090a3cf47f0825a6f4abbfffa9f27e7b80a887"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Ben looks at his dad and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Can you help me?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-you-help-me"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Ben 看著爸爸問：「你可以幫我嗎？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/after-school-homework/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "c6b193ad36cb0145da62867452eb01b02c66e8cfb6096546921411d37f19cf3f",
        "sha256": "74ce59964cef807f292a3a3470cadaa4b4bd569b9982d05b59ee5dec0e2863fd"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Dad smiles warmly and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let me see.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "let-me-see"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "爸爸親切地微笑著說：「讓我看看。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/after-school-homework/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "88c67e58b6ca4439bddac97e80318cd7232e719f25f0c252a9e94a22fcae2e5b",
        "sha256": "bec7465b726439841a21ac168767e69d6d36ddc099b14effcfa68413aabecf17"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Dad helps him step by step, and Ben happily says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "I am ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-am-finished"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "finished",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-am-finished"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "finished"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-am-finished"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "爸爸一步步引導他，Ben 開心地說：「我做完了。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/after-school-homework/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "a57ac6a3814f8f20aedcc509b90a7bcab38e4b530775ac7a79b8073705dc70bf",
        "sha256": "735e895c44fbbef2db35a0d7b8950eba677510ae02f80efddbca8a60f89f04de"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Dad gives him a high five and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Good job!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "good-job"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "爸爸和他擊掌並說：「做得好！」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/after-school-homework/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "5206c54fdb5e6f68c873143ad168a014a47ddb57b461bec10d99bb24a6253d25",
        "sha256": "42bc2815ba1c2c058af0820d02b1662596ab41cb43d8882b7c28f744f2ff0bfc"
      }
    }
  ],
